    "rating": 4.7,
    "reference": "ChIJffq3JltIyUwRvFNskJ_SQ6U",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kimberly Mcphee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100671039030755145217/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuMuNZT82pWyoeLEe0yQeh1HjQWnx4IlbjsPOHnFXXllUI-z6BYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The entire process was quick and stress free. Called reserved over the phone. Reached out the next day for confirmation and was texted 1hr before delivery,\n\nHad the cube for 5 months and when finished the pick up was just as efficient as delivery. Strongly recommend if you need storage.",
        "time": 1764141985,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "max larochelle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110135558716478713025/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIRIwkznpo6m-2OQoS9gULdadI9e3_C741tZknGQr-1QQ9uw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely terrible service. I paid in advance for a container delivery that was scheduled for today, and no one showed up. I called multiple times, no answer. The voicemail asked me to leave a message, which I did, but nobody ever called me back. Zero communication, zero professionalism.\n\nI’ve never dealt with a company that confirms a delivery and then completely disappears. If you can’t provide the service people pay for, at least have the decency to answer the phone or give an update.\n\nWould not recommend this company to anyone.",
        "time": 1762815751,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Janet Maccullie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103379486739797634618/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIV4Ae1P2ixR3DkdPJujNQ5fHtOuZc3rwpQNWwN5Bewj5u5Xw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The booking process was simple, the delivery was when it was expected.  All aspects of the process have gone smoothly. When I called to change the pick up date the process was simple and efficient. Nothing but good things to say about our experience",
        "time": 1764683372,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "m c",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107270377639076564947/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLV_xs0DqEanPpMiqANbiO_PVH1zoVNfnl-PFWII99mlu6YrA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "So far so good!  I have the cube delivery.  The driver was great, on time, got the Cube exactly where it was to go, showed me how to properly close the door so it locks - very important!   It's really clean inside.  I'm ready to pack.",
        "time": 1758111349,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Douglas Phillip",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117163816998585733192/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRbNfuFbECd7B3QtKQngI3T-Jjdc678UX-P3N3OW2BoeBKOVU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "The delivery was fantastic , driver was super nice . Every dealing that I have had , whether it be someone explaining the invoice , arranging the pickup , extending the time , etc...the person on the other end of the phone has always been pleasant , polite , friendly and seemed genuinely happy about working for Cubeit . The container itself is fantastic . I couldn't believe how nice it is and how clean.  It has worked better than I expected , no leaking during the heavy rains . The price was very reasonable and I wouldn't hesitate to recommend using Cubeit . They're proud to say that they're a Canadian company and I'm proud to say that I used their service .",
        "time": 1755175446,
        "translated": false
      }
